init	write a starter berth.toml at the repository root
config	inspect the project configuration
dev	start this worktree's services, then follow their logs until Ctrl-C
up	register this worktree, start its services, and run its hooks
down	stop this worktree's services; data is kept
status	show service status for this worktree
urls	print this worktree's routed URLs
run	run one of the project's named commands from berth.toml [commands]
backup	run the backup hook, writing a bundle into a directory
restore	run the restore hook on a bundle directory
index	refresh the machine-wide checkout index and print it
doctor	check prerequisites, the registry, the router, and this checkout's verify hook
router	manage the shared local router
route	route processes running on the host through this worktree's hostname
shared	manage the repository's shared services
worktree	manage registered worktrees
completion	print a shell completion script
help	display help for command
